nez --worktree login: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `nez fork`, `nez exec`, and `nez exec fork`
nez fork --worktree: `nez fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
nez fork --worktree --last: `nez fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
nez exec resume --worktree session: `--worktree` cannot resume an existing session; use `nez exec fork --worktree`
nez exec review --worktree: `--worktree` is not supported for code review
